distributed_plan_execute_locally = 1
in-process plan: an unrelated reader is refused while the plan holds the table's only slot
distributed_plan_execute_locally = 0
dispatched plan: the slot outlives the fragment that took it, so an unrelated reader is refused
parallel replicas
one statement holding the table's only slot on several replicas is served
client-sent secondary query, execute locally = 1: served through several fragments
client-sent secondary query, execute locally = 0: served through several fragments
